    passageB1: `<p>New studies show that <strong>passive smoking</strong>, even for a short time like 30 minutes, can <strong>harm</strong> a non-smoker's heart. Experts have been <strong>warning</strong> people about the dangers of breathing in smoke from other people's cigarettes. But many people don't seem to know much about these dangers yet.</p>

<p>In many countries, people know a lot about the dangers of smoking. They know that smoking can cause <strong>breathing problems</strong>, like lung cancer. They may choose to ignore this information, but they know it. However, they don't seem to know much about the dangers of passive smoking. </p>

<p>Most people who don't smoke think smoking is <strong>annoying</strong>. They think it causes them some <strong>discomfort</strong>, but not that it's a danger to their health. They might not like smoky air, dirty ashtrays, or cigarette ends on the ground. They might choose to sit in <strong>non-smoking areas</strong> in restaurants. But many still don't understand that being near smokers can make them sick.</p>

<p>We have known for some years that passive smoking can cause the same breathing problems as smoking. It might not be as bad, but it's still a problem. People with <strong>asthma</strong> often feel worse when there is a lot of cigarette smoke in the air.</p>

<p>Smokers who are worried about their health can try to <strong>quit smoking</strong>. Smoking is a common <strong>addiction</strong>. They can try to stop using their own <strong>willpower</strong> or use <strong>nicotine patches</strong>. Other people can only try to stay away from smokers, especially those who smoke a lot.</p>

<p>If you want to <strong>avoid</strong> the dangers of passive smoking, you can do a few simple things. Always stay away from smoking areas in public places. <strong>Ban</strong> smoking in your home. You can also <strong>politely</strong> ask your friends not to smoke near you. Maybe they will start to think about their own health too!</p>`,
    translationB1: `<p>Yangi tadqiqotlar shuni ko'rsatadiki, <strong>passiv chekish</strong>, hatto 30 daqiqa kabi qisqa vaqt davomida ham, chekmaydigan odamning yuragiga <strong>zarar</strong> yetkazishi mumkin. Mutaxassislar odamlarni boshqalarning sigaretlaridan chiqqan tutunni nafas olish xavfi haqida <strong>ogohlantirib</strong> kelmoqda. Ammo ko'pchilik bu xavflar haqida hali ko'p narsa bilmaydi.</p>

<p>Ko'pgina mamlakatlarda odamlar chekishning xavflari haqida ko'p narsa bilishadi. Ular chekish o'pka saratoni kabi <strong>nafas olish muammolariga</strong> olib kelishi mumkinligini bilishadi. Ular bu ma'lumotga e'tibor bermaslikni tanlashlari mumkin, lekin ular buni bilishadi. Biroq, ular passiv chekishning xavflari haqida ko'p narsa bilishmaydi.</p>

<p>Chekmaydigan odamlarning aksariyati chekishni <strong>bezovta qiluvchi</strong> deb o'ylashadi. Ular bu ularga qandaydir <strong>noqulaylik</strong> tug'diradi, lekin ularning sog'lig'iga xavf solmaydi deb o'ylashadi. Ularga tutunli havo, iflos kuldonlar yoki yerda yotgan sigaret qoldiqlari yoqmasligi mumkin. Ular restoranlarda <strong>chekilmaydigan joylarda</strong> o'tirishni tanlashlari mumkin. Ammo ko'pchilik hali ham chekuvchilarning yonida bo'lish ularni kasal qilishi mumkinligini tushunishmaydi.</p>

<p>Biz bir necha yildirki, passiv chekish chekish bilan bir xil nafas olish muammolariga olib kelishi mumkinligini bilamiz. Bu unchalik yomon bo'lmasligi mumkin, ammo bu hali ham muammo. <strong>Astma</strong> bilan kasallangan odamlar havoda sigaret tutuni ko'p bo'lganda o'zlarini yomon his qilishadi.</p>

<p>Sog'lig'idan xavotirda bo'lgan chekuvchilar <strong>chekishni tashlashga</strong> harakat qilishlari mumkin. Chekish - bu keng tarqalgan <strong>odat</strong>. Ular o'zlarining <strong>iroda kuchi</strong>dan foydalanib yoki <strong>nikotinli yamoqlar</strong>dan foydalanib to'xtashga harakat qilishlari mumkin. Boshqa odamlar faqat chekuvchilardan, ayniqsa ko'p chekadiganlardan uzoqroq yurishga harakat qilishlari mumkin.</p>

<p>Agar siz passiv chekish xavfidan <strong>saqlanmoqchi</strong> bo'lsangiz, bir nechta oddiy narsalarni qilishingiz mumkin. Har doim jamoat joylarida chekiladigan joylardan uzoqroq turing. Uyingizda chekishni <strong>taqiqlang</strong>. Shuningdek, do'stlaringizdan sizning yaqiningizda chekmaslikni <strong>odob bilan</strong> so'rashingiz mumkin. Ehtimol, ular ham o'z sog'lig'i haqida o'ylay boshlashadi!</p>`,
